# bboxybook parity

88 cases; 56 require review. Policy: channel tolerance 8, changed-pixel budget 0.1%. Scores rank image review, not acceptance.

Sources: L3 Style, resolved from compile-time tokens plus serialisable overrides (styles.json). The CSS backdrop/diagnostic labels and external box origin/width are common fixtures; native code resolves height/padding and paints material, fill, border, shadow and text. This is a low-level review fixture, not an L6 component/layout or legacy module rebase. Glow/frosted differences carried from L2 remain open; the shadow kernel, text rasterisation, border AA and compositing also differ from CSS. Canonical key: style/<state>-<density>-<theme>.

